msgstr "Neka allt utom …"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2189
msgid "Custom Trusted Proxy IPs / CIDRs"
msgstr "Anpassade IP-adresser/CIDR för betrodda proxyservrar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2191
msgid "Loading auto-detected proxy status..."
msgstr "Laddar in status för automatiskt upptäckta proxyservrar …"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2193
msgid ""
"Additional proxy IPs beyond the auto-detected list, one per line. Leave "
"empty if all your proxies are covered above."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare proxy-IP-adresser utöver den automatiskt upptäckta listan, en "
"per rad. Lämna tomt om alla dina proxyservrar täcks ovan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2212
msgid ""
"Tracks failed login attempts and locks out IPs after a configurable "
"threshold. Reuses the firewall allow-list for trusted IPs."
msgstr ""
"Spårar misslyckade inloggningsförsök och låser ute IP-adresser efter ett "
"konfigurerbart tröskelvärde. Återanvänder brandväggens tillåtelselista för "
"betrodda IP-adresser."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2216
msgid "Settings:"
msgstr "Inställningar:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2219
msgid "safe defaults; settings are locked."
msgstr "säkra standardvärden. Inställningarna är låsta."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2223 includes/class-segurium.php:2554
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Anpassad"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2223
msgid "edit every setting yourself."
msgstr "redigera varje inställning själv."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2244
msgid ""
"After this many lockouts within the history window, the next lockout will "
"use the extended duration."
msgstr ""
"Efter så här många utelåsningar inom historikfönstret används den utökade "
"varaktigheten för nästa utelåsning."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2265
msgid ""
"Adds an off-screen input that legitimate users never see. Filling it "
"triggers an immediate lockout."
msgstr ""
"Lägger till ett fält utanför skärmen som riktiga användare aldrig ser. Fylls"
" det i utlöses en omedelbar utelåsning."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2274
msgid ""
"Optionally show an hCaptcha challenge on the login form after a configurable"
" number of failed attempts. Get free keys at hcaptcha.com."
msgstr ""
"Visa valfritt en hCaptcha-utmaning i inloggningsformuläret efter ett "
"konfigurerbart antal misslyckade försök. Hämta kostnadsfria nycklar på "
"hcaptcha.com."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2300
msgid ""
"Must be less than the maximum failed attempts so the challenge fires before "
"the lockout."
msgstr ""
"Måste vara mindre än det maximala antalet misslyckade försök så att "
"utmaningen visas före utelåsningen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2359 includes/class-segurium.php:2372
msgid "Attempts"
msgstr "Försök"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2435
msgid "Enable Two-Factor Authentication"
msgstr "Aktivera tvåfaktorsautentisering"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2437
msgid ""
"Require users to verify their identity with a second factor during login."
msgstr ""
"Kräv att användare verifierar sin identitet med en andra faktor vid "
"inloggning."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2441
msgid "Available Methods"
msgstr "Tillgängliga metoder"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2442
msgid "Select which 2FA methods users can choose from."
msgstr "Välj vilka 2FA-metoder användare kan välja mellan."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2447
msgid "Enforced Roles"
msgstr "Obligatoriska roller"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2448
msgid "Users in these roles will be required to set up 2FA."
msgstr "Användare med dessa roller måste konfigurera 2FA."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2452
msgid "Grace Period (days)"
msgstr "Respitperiod (dagar)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2453
msgid ""
"Days before enforcement blocks login for users who have not set up 2FA. Set "
"to 0 to enforce immediately."
msgstr ""
"Antal dagar innan kravet blockerar inloggning för användare som inte har "
"konfigurerat 2FA. Sätt till 0 för att kräva det omedelbart."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2457
msgid "Trusted Device Duration (days)"
msgstr "Varaktighet för betrodd enhet (dagar)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2458
msgid ""
"How many days a device stays trusted after the user checks the trust option."
msgstr ""
"Hur många dagar en enhet förblir betrodd efter att användaren markerat "
"alternativet om förtroende."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2463 includes/class-segurium.php:3111
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Spara inställningar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2468
msgid "User Statistics"
msgstr "Användarstatistik"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2472
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Metod"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2473
msgid "Users"
msgstr "Användare"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2478
msgid "Reset User 2FA"
msgstr "Återställ 2FA för användare"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2479
msgid "Enter a username or user ID to reset their 2FA configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ange ett användarnamn eller ett användar-ID för att återställa dess 2FA-"
"konfiguration."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2480
msgid "Username or ID"
msgstr "Användarnamn eller ID"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2481
msgid "Reset 2FA"
msgstr "Återställ 2FA"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2488
msgid "Submit a support ticket below. Our team will respond via email."
msgstr "Skicka ett supportärende nedan. Vårt team svarar via e-post."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2491
msgid "Your name"
msgstr "Ditt namn"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2495
msgid "Reply-to email"
msgstr "”Svara till”-e-postadress"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2497
msgid ""
"We will reply to this address. Change it if you want the response to go "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Vi svarar till denna adress. Ändra den om du vill att svaret ska gå någon "
"annanstans."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2500
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Webbplats"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2502
msgid ""
"Included automatically so support can identify your site. Change this under "
"Settings → General."
msgstr ""
"Ingår automatiskt så att supporten kan identifiera din webbplats. Ändra "
"detta under Inställningar → Allmänt."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2505
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2507 includes/class-segurium.php:7381
msgid "Bug report"
msgstr "Felrapport"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2508 includes/class-segurium.php:7383
msgid "Feature request"
msgstr "Funktionsförslag"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2509 includes/class-segurium.php:7385
msgid "General question"
msgstr "Allmän fråga"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2510
msgid "Report missed malware"
msgstr "Rapportera missad skadlig kod"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2511
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Annat"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2515
msgid "Suspicious file"
msgstr "Misstänkt fil"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2517
msgid "Attach the file you believe is malware. Max 100 MB."
msgstr "Bifoga filen som du tror är skadlig kod. Max 100 MB."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2520
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Meddelande"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2526
msgid ""
"Attach system information (WP version, PHP version, plugin version, active "
"plugins, last scan date)"
msgstr ""
"Bifoga systeminformation (WP-version, PHP-version, tilläggets version, "
"aktiva tillägg, datum för senaste skanning)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2530
msgid "Submit Ticket"
msgstr "Skicka supportärende"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2541
msgid "Enable Security Headers"
msgstr "Aktivera säkerhetshuvuden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2543
msgid ""
"Adds HTTP security response headers to all responses. Protects against "
"clickjacking, MIME sniffing, XSS, and protocol downgrade attacks."
msgstr ""
"Lägger till HTTP-säkerhetshuvuden i alla svar. Skyddar mot clickjacking, "
"MIME-sniffning, XSS och nedgradering av protokoll."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2547
msgid "Mode:"
msgstr "Läge:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2551
msgid "Basic"
msgstr "Grundläggande"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2551
msgid "X-Content-Type, X-Frame-Options, X-XSS-Protection"
msgstr "X-Content-Type, X-Frame-Options, X-XSS-Protection"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2552
msgid "Basic + Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, HSTS"
msgstr "Grundläggande + Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, HSTS"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2553
msgid "Recommended + Cross-Origin policies, DNS prefetch, Cache-Control"
msgstr "Rekommenderad + Cross-Origin-policyer, DNS-förhämtning, Cache-Control"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2554
msgid "configure each header individually"
msgstr "konfigurera varje huvud för sig"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2565
msgid ""
"This mode emits fixed preset values. Switch to Custom to override individual"
" headers."
msgstr ""
"Detta läge skickar fasta förinställda värden. Byt till Anpassad för att "
"åsidosätta enskilda huvuden."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2568
msgid "Header Values"
msgstr "Värden för huvuden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2572 includes/class-segurium.php:2586
#: includes/class-segurium.php:2643 includes/class-segurium.php:2652
#: includes/class-segurium.php:2662
msgid "Same origin"
msgstr "Samma ursprung"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2573
msgid "Deny all"
msgstr "Neka alla"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2575
msgid "Prevents your site from being embedded in iframes on other domains."
msgstr "Hindrar att din webbplats bäddas in i iframes på andra domäner."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2582
msgid "No referrer"
msgstr "Ingen länkande webbplats"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2583
msgid "No referrer when downgrade"
msgstr "Ingen länkande webbplats vid nedgradering"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2584
msgid "Origin only"
msgstr "Endast ursprung"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2585
msgid "Origin when cross-origin"
msgstr "Ursprung vid korsande ursprung"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2587
msgid "Strict origin"
msgstr "Strikt ursprung"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2588
msgid "Strict origin when cross-origin"
msgstr "Strikt ursprung vid korsande ursprung"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2589
msgid "Unsafe URL"
msgstr "Osäker URL"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2600 includes/class-segurium.php:2604
msgid "Disabled (recommended)"
msgstr "Inaktiverad (rekommenderas)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2601 includes/class-segurium.php:2605
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Aktiverad"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2602 includes/class-segurium.php:2606
msgid "Enabled with block mode"
msgstr "Aktiverad med blockeringsläge"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2604
msgid ""
"Explicitly turns off the legacy IE/old-Edge XSS filter, which had universal-"
"XSS bugs that could be weaponised. Modern browsers ignore this header; CSP "
"is the actual XSS defence."
msgstr ""
"Stänger uttryckligen av det äldre XSS-filtret i IE och gamla Edge, som hade "
"universella XSS-buggar som gick att utnyttja. Moderna webbläsare ignorerar "
"huvudet. CSP är det verkliga XSS-skyddet."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2605
msgid ""
"Tells legacy browsers to sanitise reflections. The filter has false "
"positives that silently break valid pages and known UXSS bypasses. Not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Ber äldre webbläsare att sanera reflektioner. Filtret ger falska positiva "
"som tyst bryter giltiga sidor och har kända UXSS-kringgåenden. Rekommenderas"
" inte."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2606
msgid ""
"Same filter as above, but blocks the page entirely on suspected reflection. "
"Same bugs, plus a timing side-channel that can leak cross-origin data. Not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Samma filter som ovan, men blockerar hela sidan vid misstänkt reflektion. "
"Samma buggar, plus en tidsbaserad sidokanal som kan läcka data mellan "
"ursprung. Rekommenderas inte."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2608
msgid "HSTS (Strict-Transport-Security)"
msgstr "HSTS (Strict-Transport-Security)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2612
msgid "Enable HSTS"
msgstr "Aktivera HSTS"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2614
msgid "Forces browsers to use HTTPS. Only sent when SSL is active."
msgstr "Tvingar webbläsare att använda HTTPS. Skickas bara när SSL är aktivt."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2618
msgid "Max-Age (seconds)"
msgstr "Max-Age (sekunder)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2624
msgid "Include subdomains"
msgstr "Inkludera underdomäner"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2630
msgid "Preload"
msgstr "Förhandsladda"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2632
msgid ""
"Warning: preload is difficult to undo. Requires max-age at least 1 year and "
"subdomains included."
msgstr ""
"Varning: förinläsning är svår att ångra. Kräver max-age på minst 1 år och "
"att underdomäner ingår."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2636
msgid ""
"Your site appears to be on a subdomain. Enabling includeSubDomains in HSTS "
"will affect all subdomains of the parent domain, including ones you may not "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Din webbplats verkar ligga på en underdomän. Om du aktiverar "
"includeSubDomains i HSTS påverkas alla underdomäner till den överordnade "
"domänen, även sådana du kanske inte styr över."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2638
msgid "Cross-Origin Policies"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-policyer"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2640
msgid "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2642 includes/class-segurium.php:2651
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Inte angivet"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2644
msgid "Same origin, allow popups"
msgstr "Samma ursprung, tillåt popup-fönster"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2645 includes/class-segurium.php:2663
msgid "Unsafe none"
msgstr "Osäker: ingen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2649
msgid "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2653
msgid "Same site"
msgstr "Samma webbplats"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2654
msgid "Cross origin"
msgstr "Korsande ursprung"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2658
msgid "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2660
msgid "Not set (recommended)"
msgstr "Inte angivet (rekommenderas)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2661
msgid "Require CORP"
msgstr "Kräv CORP"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2667
msgid "Control which browser features your site may use."
msgstr "Styr vilka webbläsarfunktioner din webbplats får använda."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2671
msgid "Accelerometer"
msgstr "Accelerometer"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2672
msgid "Autoplay"
msgstr "Automatisk uppspelning"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2673
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Kamera"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2674
msgid "Encrypted media"
msgstr "Krypterade media"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2675
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "Fullskärm"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2676
msgid "Geolocation"
msgstr "Geoplacering"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2677
msgid "Gyroscope"
msgstr "Gyroskop"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2678
msgid "Magnetometer"
msgstr "Magnetometer"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2679
msgid "Microphone"
msgstr "Mikrofon"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2680
msgid "MIDI"
msgstr "MIDI"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2681
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "Betalning"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2682
msgid "USB"
msgstr "USB"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2692
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Neka"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2693
msgid "Self only"
msgstr "Endast egen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2694
msgid "Allow all"
msgstr "Tillåt alla"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2705
msgid "Send Content-Security-Policy header"
msgstr "Skicka Content-Security-Policy-huvudet"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2707
msgid ""
"CSP restricts where scripts, styles, and other resources may load from, "
"mitigating XSS and injection. CSP is site-specific and can break themes or "
"page builders — start in report-only mode to surface violations before "
"enforcing."
msgstr ""
"CSP begränsar varifrån skript, stilar och andra resurser får läsas in, "
"vilket dämpar XSS och injektion. CSP är specifik för varje webbplats och kan"
" bryta teman eller sidbyggare – börja i läget endast rapport för att se "
"överträdelser innan du tvingar den."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2713
msgid "Report-only (recommended for first deploy)"
msgstr "Endast rapport (rekommenderas vid första driftsättningen)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2714
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "Tvinga"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2716
msgid ""
"Report-only sends Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only — the browser logs "
"violations but still loads blocked resources. Enforce sends Content-"
"Security-Policy and blocks them."
msgstr ""
"Endast rapport skickar Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only – webbläsaren "
"loggar överträdelser men läser fortfarande in blockerade resurser. Tvinga "
"skickar Content-Security-Policy och blockerar dem."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2719
msgid "Policy directives"
msgstr "Policydirektiv"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2722
msgid ""
"Single line of directives separated by semicolons. The default starter "
"policy permits Gutenberg and most themes; tighten once your reports are "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"En enda rad med direktiv åtskilda av semikolon. Standardpolicyn tillåter "
"Gutenberg och de flesta teman. Skärp den när dina rapporter är rena."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2723
msgid "CSP reference (MDN)"
msgstr "CSP-referens (MDN)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2727
msgid "Report URI (optional)"
msgstr "Rapport-URI (valfritt)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2729
msgid ""
"When set, browsers will POST violation reports to this URL. Appended "
"automatically as report-uri unless your directives already contain one."
msgstr ""
"När det är angivet skickar webbläsare överträdelserapporter med POST till "
"denna URL. Läggs till automatiskt som report-uri om inte dina direktiv redan"
" innehåller ett."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2733
msgid "Cookie Hardening"
msgstr "Cookie-härdning"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2737
msgid "Add SameSite attribute to auth cookies"
msgstr "Lägg till SameSite-attribut i autentiseringscookies"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2739
msgid ""
"Adds SameSite flag to WordPress session cookies. Protects against CSRF "
"attacks. Mozilla Observatory penalizes missing SameSite."
msgstr ""
"Lägger till SameSite-flaggan i WordPress sessionscookies. Skyddar mot CSRF-"
"attacker. Mozilla Observatory drar av poäng när SameSite saknas."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2743
msgid "SameSite value"
msgstr "SameSite-värde"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2745
msgid "Lax (recommended)"
msgstr "Lax (rekommenderas)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2748
msgid ""
"Strict may break OAuth/SSO login flows that redirect back to your site."
msgstr ""
"Strikt kan bryta inloggningsflöden för OAuth och SSO som omdirigerar "
"tillbaka till din webbplats."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2759
msgid "Headers Preview"
msgstr "Förhandsgranskning av huvuden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2771
msgid "Enable Information Shield"
msgstr "Aktivera informationsskydd"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2773
msgid ""
"Reduces WordPress information disclosure by removing version fingerprints, "
"discovery endpoints, and unnecessary metadata from HTTP headers and HTML "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Minskar WordPress informationsläckage genom att ta bort versionsavtryck, "
"upptäcktsändpunkter och onödig metadata från HTTP-huvuden och HTML-utdata."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2776
msgid "Enable All Recommended"
msgstr "Aktivera alla rekommenderade"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2780
msgid "HTTP Header Disclosure"
msgstr "Läckage via HTTP-huvuden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2784
msgid "Remove X-Powered-By header"
msgstr "Ta bort X-Powered-By-huvudet"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2786
msgid "Removes the header that reveals your PHP version."
msgstr "Tar bort huvudet som avslöjar din PHP-version."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2792
msgid "Remove Server header"
msgstr "Ta bort Server-huvudet"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2794
msgid ""
"Removes the header that identifies your web server software. Best-effort."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort huvudet som identifierar din webbservers programvara. Görs så långt"
" det går."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2800
msgid "Remove X-Pingback header"
msgstr "Ta bort X-Pingback-huvudet"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2802
msgid "Hides the pingback/XML-RPC endpoint URL from response headers."
msgstr "Döljer URL:en till pingback- och XML-RPC-ändpunkten i svarshuvudena."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2807
msgid "Remove REST API Link: header"
msgstr "Ta bort REST API Link:-huvudet"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2809
msgid "Removes the HTTP Link header that advertises the REST API endpoint."
msgstr "Tar bort HTTP-huvudet Link som annonserar REST API-ändpunkten."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2814
msgid "Remove Shortlink Link: header"
msgstr "Ta bort Shortlink Link:-huvudet"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2816
msgid "Removes the rel=shortlink HTTP header."
msgstr "Tar bort HTTP-huvudet rel=shortlink."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2819
msgid "HTML Meta and Links"
msgstr "HTML-metataggar och länkar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2823
msgid "Remove WordPress generator tag"
msgstr "Ta bort WordPress generator-tagg"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2825
msgid ""
"Removes the meta generator tag and RSS generator that reveal your WordPress "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort metataggen generator och RSS-generatorn som avslöjar din WordPress-"
"version."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2830
msgid "Remove RSD link"
msgstr "Ta bort RSD-länken"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2832
msgid "Removes the Really Simple Discovery endpoint link from HTML head."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort länken till Really Simple Discovery-ändpunkten från HTML-huvudet."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2837
msgid "Remove WLW manifest link"
msgstr "Ta bort WLW-manifestlänken"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2839
msgid ""
"Removes the Windows Live Writer manifest link. Only needed if you use WLW to"
" write posts."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort manifestlänken för Windows Live Writer. Behövs bara om du använder "
"WLW för att skriva inlägg."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2844
msgid "Remove REST API discovery link"
msgstr "Ta bort länken för REST API-upptäckt"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2846
msgid ""
"Removes the discovery link tag from HTML head. The REST API itself remains "
"functional at /wp-json/."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort upptäcktslänkens tagg från HTML-huvudet. Själva REST API fungerar "
"fortfarande på /wp-json/."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2851
msgid "Remove oEmbed discovery links"
msgstr "Ta bort länkar för oEmbed-upptäckt"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2853
msgid ""
"Prevents other sites from showing rich embed previews when linking to your "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Hindrar andra webbplatser från att visa rika förhandsgranskningar av "
"inbäddning när de länkar till ditt innehåll."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2858
msgid "Remove shortlink meta tag"
msgstr "Ta bort metataggen shortlink"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2860
msgid "Removes the shortlink link tag from HTML head."
msgstr "Tar bort länktaggen shortlink från HTML-huvudet."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2865
msgid "Remove emoji scripts and styles"
msgstr "Ta bort emojiskript och emojistilar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2867
msgid ""
"Removes the WordPress emoji polyfill JavaScript and CSS. Modern browsers "
"have native emoji support."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort WordPress polyfill i JavaScript och CSS för emoji. Moderna "
"webbläsare har inbyggt stöd för emoji."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2872
msgid "Remove RSS/Atom feed links"
msgstr "Ta bort länkar till RSS- och Atom-flöden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2874
msgid ""
"May break RSS readers and WordPress.com Reader. Only enable if your site "
"does not use RSS feeds."
msgstr ""
"Kan bryta RSS-läsare och WordPress.com Reader. Aktivera bara om din "
"webbplats inte använder RSS-flöden."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2879
msgid "Remove adjacent post links"
msgstr "Ta bort länkar till intilliggande inlägg"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2881
msgid "Removes prev/next post rel links from HTML head."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort rel-länkarna till föregående och nästa inlägg från HTML-huvudet."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2884
msgid "Asset Fingerprinting"
msgstr "Filavtryck"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2888
msgid "Remove version query strings"
msgstr "Ta bort versionsfrågesträngar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2890
msgid ""
"Strips ?ver= from CSS and JavaScript URLs. Browser-cached assets may become "
"stale after plugin or theme updates."
msgstr ""
"Tar bort ?ver= från URL:er till CSS och JavaScript. Filer som webbläsaren "
"cachat kan bli inaktuella efter uppdateringar av tillägg eller teman."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2897
msgid "Disable XML-RPC entirely"
msgstr "Inaktivera XML-RPC helt"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2899
msgid ""
"Some plugins (Jetpack, WordPress mobile app) require XML-RPC. Disable only "
"if you do not use them."
msgstr ""
"Vissa tillägg (Jetpack, WordPress mobilapp) kräver XML-RPC. Inaktivera bara "
"om du inte använder dem."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2911
msgid "Security Self-Check"
msgstr "Självkontroll av säkerheten"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2913
msgid ""
"Segurium runs the same checks as leading external security scanners, plus "
"WordPress-specific hardening checks, and grades your site A+ to F. Results "
"are saved until the next run."
msgstr ""
"Segurium kör samma kontroller som ledande externa säkerhetsskannrar, plus "
"WordPress-specifika härdningskontroller, och betygsätter din webbplats från "
"A+ till F. Resultatet sparas till nästa körning."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2932
msgid "Check results"
msgstr "Kontrollresultat"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2934
msgid "Independent verification"
msgstr "Oberoende verifiering"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2936
msgid "Cross-check results with these public scanners:"
msgstr "Dubbelkolla resultatet med dessa publika skannrar:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2939
msgid "securityheaders.com"
msgstr "securityheaders.com"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2940
msgid "Mozilla Observatory"
msgstr "Mozilla Observatory"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2954
msgid "Cleanup: 3 files / 30 days"
msgstr "Rensning: 3 filer/30 dagar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2955
msgid "Full malware detection — same findings as Pro"
msgstr "Full upptäckt av skadlig kod – samma fynd som i Pro"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2956
msgid "Auto-fix and Bulk Fix All"
msgstr "Automatisk åtgärd och åtgärda alla i grupp"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2957
msgid "Hardening: 2FA, brute-force, geo-blocking, firewall, security headers"
msgstr ""
"Härdning: 2FA, brute force, geoblockering, brandvägg, säkerhetshuvuden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2958
msgid "File-integrity monitoring (core / plugins / themes)"
msgstr "Övervakning av filintegritet (kärna/tillägg/teman)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2959
msgid "Migration importer (Wordfence, AIOS, Solid Security)"
msgstr "Migreringsimportör (Wordfence, AIOS, Solid Security)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2960
msgid "Community support"
msgstr "Community-support"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2963
msgid "Unlimited cleanup"
msgstr "Obegränsad rensning"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2964
msgid "Everything in Free"
msgstr "Allt i Gratis"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2965
msgid "Email support, priority queue"
msgstr "E-postsupport, prioriterad kö"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2973
msgid ""
"Every feature ships on every install. Pro lifts the monthly cleanup cap."
msgstr ""
"Alla funktioner ingår i varje installation. Pro tar bort det månatliga "
"rensningstaket."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2980 includes/class-segurium.php:3003
msgid "Current plan"
msgstr "Nuvarande paket"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2983 includes/class-segurium.php:3208
msgid "Free"
msgstr "Gratis"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2985
msgid "Every feature, on every site. Cleanups capped at 3 per 30 days."
msgstr ""
"Alla funktioner, på varje webbplats. Rensningar är begränsade till 3 per 30 "
"dagar."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2990
msgid "forever"
msgstr "för alltid"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3012
msgid "Unlimited cleanup. Same features as Free, with no monthly cap."
msgstr "Obegränsad rensning. Samma funktioner som i Gratis, utan månadstak."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3017
msgid "/year per site"
msgstr "/år per webbplats"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3029
msgid "14-day money-back guarantee."
msgstr "14 dagars pengarna-tillbaka-garanti."

#. translators: 1: opening anchor tag, 2: closing anchor tag
#: includes/class-segurium.php:3040
msgid ""
"Bundles for 5 and 25 sites, plus 100+ quotes, on "
"%1$ssegurium.com/pricing/%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Paket för 5 och 25 webbplatser, plus offerter för 100+, på "
"%1$ssegurium.com/pricing/%2$s."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3058
msgid "Scan Settings"
msgstr "Skanningsinställningar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3061
msgid ""
"Exclude files from scan that match these wildcard patterns (one per line)"
msgstr ""
"Exkludera filer från skanningen som matchar dessa mönster med jokertecken "
"(ett per rad)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3063
msgid ""
"Use * as a wildcard. For example, *.log will exclude all log files. vendor/*"
" will exclude the vendor directory and everything inside it."
msgstr ""
"Använd * som jokertecken. Till exempel exkluderar *.log alla loggfiler. "
"vendor/* exkluderar katalogen vendor och allt i den."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3071
msgid ""
"When enabled, file contents may be shared with Segurium Cloud for advanced "
"malware detection and cloud-powered cleanup. Only suspicious files are "
"transmitted. Turn it off for On-premise mode: scans then send SHA-256 "
"hashes, file paths, and metadata only, and a file the cloud cannot identify "
"by hash stays unresolved. Reporting a false positive or attaching a file to "
"a support ticket still sends that file, because you pick it yourself."
msgstr ""
"När det är aktiverat kan filinnehåll delas med Segurium Cloud för avancerad "
"upptäckt av skadlig kod och molndriven rensning. Bara misstänkta filer "
"överförs. Stäng av det för läget på plats: skanningar skickar då bara "
"SHA-256-hashar, filsökvägar och metadata, och en fil som molnet inte kan "
"identifiera med hash förblir oavgjord. Att rapportera ett falskt positivt "
"eller bifoga en fil till ett supportärende skickar ändå filen, eftersom du "
"väljer den själv."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3076
msgid "Wipe encrypted backups when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr "Radera krypterade säkerhetskopior när tillägget avinstalleras"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3078
msgid ""
"Off (default): encrypted backups of deleted components and cured files are "
"kept in the uploads/segurium-data directory after uninstall, so a reinstall "
"can still restore them. Turn on only if you want a hard deletion on "
"uninstall."
msgstr ""
"Av (standard): krypterade säkerhetskopior av borttagna komponenter och "
"botade filer sparas i katalogen uploads/segurium-data efter "
"avinstallationen, så att en ominstallation fortfarande kan återställa dem. "
"Slå på det bara om du vill ha en hård radering vid avinstallation."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3084
msgid "Email me about findings"
msgstr "Skicka e-post till mig om fynd"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3086
msgid ""
"Send a daily digest of malware verdicts and successful cleanups, delivered "
"from support@segurium.com. At most one email per site per 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"Skicka ett dagligt sammandrag av utlåtanden om skadlig kod och lyckade "
"rensningar, från support@segurium.com. Högst ett e-postmeddelande per "
"webbplats per 24 timmar."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3087
msgid "Alert email address"
msgstr "E-postadress för varningar"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3095
msgid "Leave blank to use the WordPress site admin email."
msgstr ""
"Lämna tomt för att använda WordPress e-postadress för "
"webbplatsadministratören."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3105
msgid "Automatically clean detected malware"
msgstr "Rensa upptäckt skadlig kod automatiskt"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3107
msgid ""
"After every scheduled or real-time scan, files with a known malware or "
"injection verdict are cleaned without requiring a click. Files you have "
"ignored (by path or by hash) are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Efter varje schemalagd skanning eller realtidsskanning rensas filer med känt"
" utlåtande om skadlig kod eller injektion utan att kräva ett klick. Filer "
"som du har ignorerat (via sökväg eller hash) hoppas över."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3117
msgid "Scheduled Scan"
msgstr "Schemalagd skanning"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3119
msgid ""
"Run a full malware scan automatically on a recurring schedule. A scheduled "
"scan does the same work as a manual scan, but does not require you to keep "
"your browser open. A scheduled tick that fires while a manual scan is "
"already in progress is skipped, not queued."
msgstr ""
"Kör en fullständig skanning efter skadlig kod automatiskt enligt ett "
"återkommande schema. En schemalagd skanning gör samma arbete som en manuell "
"skanning, men kräver inte att du håller din webbläsare öppen. En schemalagd "
"körning som startar medan en manuell skanning redan pågår hoppas över, den "
"köas inte."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3146
msgid "Save Schedule"
msgstr "Spara schemat"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3154
msgid ""
"Import settings from other security plugins into Segurium. Existing Segurium"
" settings are preserved; imported data is merged."
msgstr ""
"Importera inställningar från andra säkerhetstillägg till Segurium. "
"Befintliga inställningar i Segurium bevaras. Importerade data slås samman."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3205
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Version"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3207
msgid "Plan"
msgstr "Paket"

